    "expectedRule": "Panopticon City freezes entry gear {blindlineCutter, predictiveVisor, matteShell, inversePrism} from the equipped loadout into law.entryGear at dungeon entry (weapon blindline_cutter, head predictive_visor, armor matte_shell, charm inverse_prism). A three-phase scan advances on every legal run/move: scanPhase cycles 0→1→2→0 and moveCount increments by one; the destination node's grid position (x+y)%3 is the targetPhase, and scanned = targetPhase === phaseBefore. Before a route is selected every scan exposes (route null is not shadow); after selecting shadow, scanned moves log 影路遮蔽 and never expose. Exposure deals maxHp*8% damage (matteShell halves to 4%, floored, min 1) and increments exposureCount; the decoy route additionally grants 120 run rewardPoints per exposure (decoyRewardsGranted, clamped at 3 so the 4th exposure grants nothing) and the refraction route deals 4% (matteShell 2%) and grants one refractionCharge per exposure (clamped at 3). predictiveVisor (not equipped in this fixture band) would evade the first exposure per phase; the equivalent boundary evidence here is the matteShell halving and the decoy/refraction clamps. Illegal moves (closed route gate, non-adjacent) do not advance the scan. The law display is `相位:${scanPhase}，移动:${moveCount}，曝光:${exposureCount}，中继:${completedRelayCount}/3，路线:${route label or 未选择}，折光:${refractionCharges}/3，诱饵奖励:${decoyRewardsGranted}/3，Boss快照:${snapshot ? route/exposure/charges : 未冻结}` with severity danger/warning/stable/resolved and meter {value: completedRelayCount, max: 3}. Three relay nodes (north_blind_relay, central_blind_relay, south_blind_relay) complete on first node/collect-reward (relays[nodeId]=true); after the third, pendingRouteNodeId is set to that relay and departure is blocked ('三座盲区中继已经闭环，请先选择影路、诱饵或折光路线再离开。') until law/select-panopticon-route {route} permanently selects one of shadow/decoy/refraction (log 监察城路线已永久冻结：影路潜行。); an early select, a select at a non-pending node, or a second select is a domain-rejected no-op. Route nodes carry selection gates: only the selected route's node opens ('完成三座盲区中继后选择影路路线；其余路线将永久关闭。' etc.), the others stay closed and run/move through them is rejected illegal-move. The boss gate to all_sight_warden is a panopticon_boss_ready gate ('完成三座盲区中继并选择潜入路线后，万目监察者入口开放。') that opens only with three relays plus a selected route; moving onto the boss before that is departure-blocked by the pending route node. Starting the all_sight_warden boss combat freezes bossSnapshot {route, exposureCount: max(0, exposureCount - inversePrism), refractionCharges: min(3, refractionCharges + (inversePrism && route==='refraction'))} and makes the law immutable: the route can no longer be re-selected (domain-rejected). With blindline_cutter equipped, the boss encounter gains outgoingDamage force/art +min(15, (snapshot.exposureCount + snapshot.refractionCharges) * 3) percent. The boss awakens mid-fight (万目齐睁). Node rewards are idempotent: collecting panopticon_gate pays once (rewardPoints 850→1470, run loot 620, focus_incense/dispel_talisman/armor_patch 3→4, gate_sigil 1) and a second collect is domain-rejected ('监察城正门已经领取过奖励。'). Law state (scanPhase, moveCount, exposureCount, relays, route, refractionCharges, decoyRewardsGranted, bossSnapshot, entryGear), display status, and reward points persist through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
